{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33701","headline":"慧山寺肄业送怀坦上人 · 李骘","name":"慧山寺肄业送怀坦上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"流水何山分，浮云空中遇。\n我生无根株，聚散亦难固。\n忆昨鬬龙春，岩栖侣高步。\n清怀去羁束，幽境无滓污。\n日落九峰明，烟生万华暮。\n兹欢未云隔，前笑倏已故。\n四时难信留，百草换霜露。\n离襟一成解，怅抱将何谕。\n惊泉有余哀，永日谁与度。\n缅思孤帆影，再往重江路。\n去去忽凄悲，因风暂回顾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李骘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33701.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33701","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}